WEBVTT

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:14.030
<i>DOKI - Chihiro</i>

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:14.030
<i>DOKI</i>

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:20.870
<b>fukigenna tenki moyou ga nori utsutteta aitsu</b>

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:20.870
<b>不機嫌な天気模様が乗り移ってたアイツ</b>

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:20.870
<b>That fellow was affected by bad weather</b>

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:27.040
<b>nanda! chotto naname ni sora wo miteta dake ka</b>

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:27.040
<b>なんだ！　ちょっとナナメに空を見てただけか</b>

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:27.040
<b>What! He's only squinting at the sky</b>

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.630
<b>shiritai (misetai)</b>

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.630
<b>知りたい（見せたい）</b>

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.630
<b>I want to know (I want to see)</b>

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.210
<b>wakaritai (wakaranai)</b>

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.210
<b>解りたい（解らない）</b>

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.210
<b>I want to understand (I can't understand)</b>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.800
<b>nakitai (nakenai)</b>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.800
<b>泣きたい（泣けない）</b>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.800
<b>I want to cry (I can't cry)</b>

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.380
<b>soredemo</b>

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.380
<b>それでも</b>

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.380
<b>Even so,</b>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.970
<b>shikatanai (kubomanai)</b>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.970
<b>仕方ない（凹まない）</b>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.970
<b>It can't be helped (Not feeling depressed)</b>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.590
<b>itakunai (youkumonai)</b>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.590
<b>痛くない（痒くもない）</b>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.590
<b>It doesn't hurt (It doesn't itch)</b>

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.970
<b>kowashitai (kowaretai)</b>

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.970
<b>壊したい（壊れたい）</b>

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.970
<b>I want to break (I want to be broken)</b>

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.640
<b>yuzurenai omoi nara</b>

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.640
<b>譲れない思いなら</b>

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.640
<b>I don't want to surrender these feelings</b>

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:47.400
<b>chiratsuku kiiro shingou mushishite</b>

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:47.400
<b>ちらつく黄色信号　無視して</b>

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:47.400
<b>Just ignore that flashing yellow signal</b>

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:53.030
<b>kou kakudo de joushou chuu kokoro no flying saucer</b>

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:53.030
<b>高角度で上昇中　心のflying saucer</b>

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:53.030
<b>The flying saucer in my heart is rising at a sharp angle</b>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:59.870
<b>nakanaka sunao ni nan nai himitsu no tobira ni keri irete!</b>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:59.870
<b>なかなか素直になんない秘密のトビラに蹴り入れて！</b>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:59.870
<b>It kicks open that dishonest, secret door</b>

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.080
<b>chuugaeri de mata modotte kuru yo</b>

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.080
<b>宙返りでまた戻ってくるよ</b>

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.080
<b>Do a loop-the-loop and return once more {Loop-the-Loop is the title of this song}</b>

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:11.500
<b>sakaraenai jiryoku mitai na omoi yo todoke!</b>

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:11.500
<b>逆らえない磁力みたいな思いよ　届け！</b>

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:11.500
<b>Convey those seemingly irresistable magnetic feelings to you!</b>

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:19.180
<b>omote no kādo de shoubu shinai nande</b>

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:19.180
<b>表のカードで勝負しないなんで</b>

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:19.180
<b>You can't use a face card to decide the victory.</b>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.060
<b>dare no tame no moraru?</b>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.060
<b>誰のためのモラル？</b>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.060
<b>Whose morals are those?</b>

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:35.440
Motto To LOVE-Ru 04

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:35.440
<u>Things That Move in the Dark</u>

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.030
Lala-san, what are these things?

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:35.030
You've made a big mess in the corridor.

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:37.990
I'm sorry!

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:40.370
It looks like there's something wrong with The Dial. {isn't it Di-, or De- Dial?}

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:41.530
Things were coming out on their own.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:43.490
I'll tidy these up right away.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:44.910
Jeez...

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:48.250
You've got quite a lot of different things...

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:50.750
You shouldn't touch that!

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:53.630
If you carelessly touch Lala's things, you won't know what will happen.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:56.510
I-I'm sorry!

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:09.150
Rito? Haruna?

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:13.730
Ouch!

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:20.240
Ow... What the hell?

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:23.080
It's dark. I can't see anything.

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:31.630
What's this?

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:36.550
It's warm, and soft...

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.340
No!

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:44.430
S-Sairenji, why are you naked?

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.560
Eh? Me too?

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:48.560
Pyon Pyon Warp-kun?

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:52.230
That's right! It's the item I use for an emergency get-away!

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:55.270
However, it has a defect: it cannot warp your clothes along with you.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:59.240
So Yuuki-kun and Sairenji-san are...

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.200
That's shameless...

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:05.910
Let's go and find them right now, Lala-san!

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:07.080
Eh? Why?

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.910
Just do it! Right now!

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:13.580
Sairenji...

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.210
I'm really sorry.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.050
She's not saying a thing... {nani mo ittekurenai - I've not learnt the -te + kuru construction yet.}{basically means, no speech is coming from her. So it's TLed correctly}

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:28.930
As I thought, that soft sensation earlier was Haruna-chan's...

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.940
Yuuki-kun...

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:33.520
Haruna-chan?

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.190
I'm... scared.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.740
Don't worry. I'm here.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:46.910
Yuuki-kun...

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:56.590
Oh no! Having got used to the dark, I can see her naked body clearly!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.840
Sairenji. Use this to cover up your body.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:06.600
No!

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.390
I'm sorry!

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:11.390
Don't worry...

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:14.520
Calm down! I need to calm down!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:17.270
There's a door over there.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.360
It's no good. It won't open.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:24.200
It's probably locked.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.030
Damn it!

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:29.830
We'll just have to wait here until Lala finds us.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.420
Sniff Sniff Trace-kun - Improved! {Maybe we should call this Trace-kun v2 or something less weird}

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:38.920
Find Rito and Haruna.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.900
What's up with this shameless invention?!

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:59.270
Jeez... Trace-kun - Improved... {v2? Same here}

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.030
Rito and Haruna won't be in a place like that!

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.860
That's not the problem!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:05.360
Stop it! Let me go! No!

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.950
Where is this place anyway?

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:15.120
For now, I think we're still on Earth...

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.960
By the way, Sairenji...

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:18.920
I'm really sorry!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:21.380
I always get you involved with weird situations. {drag? involve? }

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.510
Don't worry about it.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.850
I see. Thank goodness.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:42.230
I need to say something...

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:45.440
Even though I'm not scared anymore because of Yuuki-kun...

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.950
My heart's thumping so much, it's making me nervous...

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.700
If I don't start a conversation, I won't be able to calm down!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.330
Oh yeah! Sairenji...

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:59.960
What's up with your parents?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:03.090
You live with your sister, right?

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:04.550
Yeah.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:07.590
A while back, everyone in our family lived together.

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:12.890
When I was 13, my dad needed to move{migrate} because of his work.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:18.020
Because Onee-chan and I did not want to leave this town, we stayed behind.

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:22.480
My mum was worried about my dad, so she left with him.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:26.610
Eh? So your family is completely different from mine.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:30.490
My parents love to walk their own paths.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:33.200
Your dad's a mangaka and your mum's a designer, right?

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:37.330
But your parents get on really well, right?

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.580
I think that's wonderful.

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:44.380
Even though they're apart, they trust each other because of the bond they share. {TLC}

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:47.840
I guess you could say that...

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.800
I also...

00:06:53.390 --> 00:07:00.730
I also want to live with someone I trust, but... {TLC}

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:22.790
I want to tell her my feelings...

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.790
But... But...

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:30.720
Oh my!

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:34.350
When I thought I heard voices from the unused room in the basement...

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:37.220
Why are you two in a place like this?

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:39.060
Mi-

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.310
Mikado-sensei!

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:43.060
So that means... We're at...

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:46.020
...Mikado-sensei's clinic?! {I think it's hospital}

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:47.780
Oh my...

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:51.240
I had no idea you were this daring.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.990
You've got the wrong idea, Sensei.

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:56.490
They're in here.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:01.830
Rito! Haruna! There you are!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.460
You guys! Dressed like that... How shameless!

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:03.960
That was close.{It said "girigiri safu"}

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.840
Hurry up and put your clothes on!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:11.130
Kotegawa! No need to get so angry!

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:13.380
Being young is fun!

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.890
Mikado-sensei, you've got it all wrong!

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:30.860
Motto To LOVE-Ru 05

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:30.860
<u>Welcome to the Yuuki Household!</u>

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:29.400
Ah! She's here!

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.240
Mikan!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.150
Let's go and play somewhere!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:35.820
Ah, sorry!

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:38.830
Today, my teacher is coming for a house visit. {TLC: lol wtf? surely it says something else}{This is correct. But we dont do such a thing. a house visit maybe? up to the eidtor}

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:40.870
Oh, I see.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.790
Let's go next time, OK?

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.580
Alright, I understand. Bye!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.800
Hey, Dad! When are you going to come home?

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.970
You have a deadline? No way...

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.600
Oh... I see.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.980
Good luck with work!

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:08.520
Your father isn't coming back?

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:09.770
Yeah.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.400
In that case, we can't have the house visit. {TLC: same as above}

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:15.450
Give your teacher a call and arrange it for another day.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:16.530
I guess I should.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:21.830
But we've already postponed it a few times already.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:25.910
I see. It's bad to postpone it again...

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:29.460
I know! I've got a good idea.

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.840
This must be Yuuki-san's house.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:41.470
At last, I can meet Yuuki Saibai-sensei. {TLC: I know I'm missing something here.} {That's Rito's, and Mikan's dad I think}

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.060
[Hero College]

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:51.320
This won't do. I must do my job first.

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:54.690
Coming!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:02.370
Um... Hello! I am Mikan's teacher, Mito Haruko!

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:08.920
H-Hello! I am Yuuki Saibai.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:16.090
It's too much for him! She'll see through him.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.680
Really? I think his disguise is perfect.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.390
Pleased to meet you!

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.640
See? It's going just fine.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.020
Seriously?

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.190
I'm so nervous!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:31.610
But since it's become like this,

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.610
I have to give the teacher a good impression for Mikan's sake!

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:38.200
This guy is Yuuki Saibai-sensei.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:41.120
He looks a lot younger than I thought.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:45.040
Who is the lady next to him?

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:48.540
Mikan-chan's mother is abroad.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:51.130
His elder sister? But they don't look alike...

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:54.380
Um... You are...

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:59.380
Me? I am... Um...

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:01.930
Lala-san! Tell her a convincing lie!{TLC}

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:03.680
I am his lover!

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:05.140
Lover!?

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:06.100
No!

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.310
Sensei, that was a joke.

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.730
This is my cousin.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.270
Oh, so that's how it is. That surprised me.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:18.400
Rito! Change the topic quickly!{Choose a topic?}

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.950
Sensei!

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:21.570
Yes!

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:27.160
How is... Mikan... getting on... at school?

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:29.540
Where did you come from? {What type of person are you?}

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:34.540
Mikan-chan is a clever and obedient kid.

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.750
Everyone in class respects her.

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:42.590
If Dad hears this, I am sure he would also be very happy!

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:43.550
Dad?

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:49.470
Um... I was talking to myself... {TLC}

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:52.770
Is Rito going to be alright?

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.230
He's so nervous.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:58.230
For Mikan's sake... For Mikan's sake...

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:01.240
He's the type that's bad at lying. {TLC}

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:05.200
Oh yeah! Just wait a sec.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.450
Lala-san?

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:22.510
Um... Dad...

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:25.260
I have something to ask of you.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.430
W-What is it?

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:34.480
I've... actually always been a big fan of your manga, Saibai-sensei.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:38.770
Can I have your autograph?

00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:41.440
Oh? So it's like that, Sensei.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:42.990
I-I understand!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:47.410
Wait, Ri- I meant, Dad!

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:54.410
For Mikan's sake... For Mikan's sake...

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:04.550
There you go.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.090
Hey! Where did you write it!?

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:12.930
[Saibai]

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:08.300
Eh?

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:09.390
You give that to me.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:15.560
Jeez! You're too nervous!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:19.560
If you don't calm down, she'll think you're a weird dad.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.900
Sorry.

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:25.110
Rito! I've brought something good!

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:26.910
Drink this!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.990
Lala-san, what is that?

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:30.370
It will calm you down.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:33.290
It's a powerful herb drink from Deviluke! {Definite TLC}

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:45.300
As expected of the herb!

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.550
Alright Rito! Back to work!

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:52.470
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:55.730
Um... Please don't worry about it.

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:58.150
I'm very happy to have got this.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:03.070
Isn't Rito acting a little strange?

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:09.160
It looks like that herb acts like alcohol on humans.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.470
What are you doing?!

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:35.810
Get away from her! {TLC}

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:50.360
What the hell are you doing, you idiot?!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.620
[Staff Room]

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.920
Hey, is Mikan not ready yet?

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:05.170
Like I said, Yuuki-san, even though you must be having a hard time at home,

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:08.550
do you best! I won't stop being his fan either.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:21.850
Motto To LOVE-Ru 06

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:21.850
<u>Slumber Party</u>

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:23.690
Sukiyaki, right?

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:27.530
That's right! There's a sukiyaki party at Rito's house.

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.440
Wanna come along too, Yami-chan?

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:35.660
Hey, I told you Yami wouldn't come, right?

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.750
Besides, she's after my life. {TLC}

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.370
That tastes nice, right?

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.620
You're interested in food?

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.750
Sukiyaki party?

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:47.670
